    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the solo developer behind Cosmix comes <i>Echoes of the Wild</i>, a third-person exploration game about a mystical journey through silence, memory, and the echoes of a lost world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/245fffef44ed73262f7c3a829960bb77.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of a majestic stag wandering through a vast, surreal wilderness long after the fall of humanity. As the player explores forgotten landscapes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/25899bc3d3df5e2cd655c3040a7fd1fa.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they uncover ancient runes\u2014each one activating haunting audio fragments recorded during the final days of World War III in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a quiet walk through a dying earth becomes a deeply human tale told through the remnants of those who once lived, loved, and lost. With each rune discovered, a piece of the story unfolds\u2014revealing how mankind faded, and what was left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you simply witness the echoes, or find meaning in the ruins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/c812c1b47b83d8bb14efc7b58b1a02c7.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>The First Tree</i>, <i>Journey</i>, and <i>Firewatch</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditative and emotional story told through atmosphere, sound, and exploration\u2014not combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover runes that trigger voice recordings from a fictional 2025, each adding depth to the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visually stunning world with lighting, ambient soundscapes, and soft toon design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short experience (~1.5/2 hours), perfect for an evening of quiet reflection and discovery.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the solo developer behind Cosmix comes <i>Echoes of the Wild</i>, a third-person exploration game about a mystical journey through silence, memory, and the echoes of a lost world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/245fffef44ed73262f7c3a829960bb77.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of a majestic stag wandering through a vast, surreal wilderness long after the fall of humanity. As the player explores forgotten landscapes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/25899bc3d3df5e2cd655c3040a7fd1fa.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they uncover ancient runes\u2014each one activating haunting audio fragments recorded during the final days of World War III in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a quiet walk through a dying earth becomes a deeply human tale told through the remnants of those who once lived, loved, and lost. With each rune discovered, a piece of the story unfolds\u2014revealing how mankind faded, and what was left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you simply witness the echoes, or find meaning in the ruins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632660/extras/c812c1b47b83d8bb14efc7b58b1a02c7.avif?t=1750409137\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>The First Tree</i>, <i>Journey</i>, and <i>Firewatch</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditative and emotional story told through atmosphere, sound, and exploration\u2014not combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover runes that trigger voice recordings from a fictional 2025, each adding depth to the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visually stunning world with lighting, ambient soundscapes, and soft toon design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short experience (~1.5/2 hours), perfect for an evening of quiet reflection and discovery.</p></li></ul>",
